<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta name="google-site-verification" content="xDElBdWOqA8qaeZKdmvFT_7eZ8BuPlCzQQmfqJkNroo" />
<meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0"/>
<title>Asistente AI del Yangyiquan | 阳意拳 · Pedro Barros, Instructor Jefe</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel+Decorative:wght@700;900&family=Cinzel:wght@400;600;700&family=Ma+Shan+Zheng&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
<style>
:root{--bg:#07070D;--bg2:#0F0F1A;--bg3:#161622;--gold:#d4af37;--g2:#b8960c;--cream:#f0e6c8;--muted:#8a7a60;--dim:#3a2a10;}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;}
html,body{height:100%;overflow:hidden;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--cream);}

.layout{display:flex;height:100vh;overflow:hidden;}

/* SIDEBAR */
.sidebar{width:280px;flex-shrink:0;background:var(--bg2);border-right:1px solid rgba(212,175,55,.15);display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden;transition:width .3s;}
.sidebar.collapsed{width:0;}
.sidebar-header{padding:20px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(212,175,55,.12);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-shrink:0;}
.sidebar-header img{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;border:1.5px solid var(--gold);}
.sidebar-title{font-family:'Cinzel',serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--gold);font-weight:600;line-height:1;}
.sidebar-sub{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:9px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:3px;}
.sidebar-section{padding:14px 18px 6px;font-family:'Cinzel',serif;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:3px;color:var(--dim);text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:500;}
.topic-btn{width:100%;text-align:left;padding:9px 18px;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;transition:all .2s;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;}
.topic-btn:hover{color:var(--cream);background:rgba(212,175,55,.06);}
.topic-btn .dot{width:4px;height:4px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--g2);flex-shrink:0;}
.sidebar-footer{margin-top:auto;padding:14px 18px;border-top:1px solid rgba(212,175,55,.1);}
.back-link{font-family:'Cinzel',serif;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:3px;color:var(--dim);text-decoration:none;transition:color .2s;}
.back-link:hover{color:var(--gold);}

/* MAIN CHAT */
.main{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden;}
.chat-header{padding:14px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(212,175,55,.12);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;background:var(--bg2);flex-shrink:0;}
.chat-header-left{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;}
.chat-avatar{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;overflow:hidden;border:1.5px solid var(--gold);flex-shrink:0;}
.chat-avatar img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;}
.chat-name{font-family:'Cinzel',serif;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--gold);font-weight:600;}
.chat-status{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;}
.status-dot{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#4CAF7A;animation:pulse .5s ease-in-out infinite alternate;}
@keyframes pulse{from{opacity:.4}to{opacity:1}}
.sidebar-toggle{background:none;border:1px solid var(--dim);color:var(--muted);padding:6px 10px;cursor:pointer;font-size:14px;transition:all .2s;}
.sidebar-toggle:hover{color:var(--gold);border-color:var(--gold);}

.chat-messages{flex:1;overflow-y:auto;padding:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;}
.chat-messages::-webkit-scrollbar{width:4px;}
.chat-messages::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:var(--dim);border-radius:2px;}

.msg{max-width:82%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;}
.msg.user{align-self:flex-end;align-items:flex-end;}
.msg.bot{align-self:flex-start;align-items:flex-start;}
.msg-header{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:400;}
.msg-bubble{padding:12px 16px;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:300;}
.msg.user .msg-bubble{background:rgba(212,175,55,.12);color:var(--cream);border-right:2px solid var(--gold);}
.msg.bot .msg-bubble{background:var(--bg3);color:var(--cream);border-left:2px solid var(--g2);}
.msg-bubble strong{color:var(--gold);font-weight:600;}
.msg-bubble em{color:#c8b880;font-style:italic;}
.msg-bubble .zh{font-family:'Ma Shan Zheng',serif;font-size:20px;color:var(--gold);opacity:.7;margin-right:6px;}

.typing{align-self:flex-start;}
.typing-dots{display:flex;gap:4px;align-items:center;padding:14px 18px;background:var(--bg3);border-left:2px solid var(--g2);}
.typing-dot{width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--muted);animation:typingBounce 1.2s ease-in-out infinite;}
.typing-dot:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.2s;}
.typing-dot:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.4s;}
@keyframes typingBounce{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0)}50%{transform:translateY(-5px);background:var(--gold);}}

.suggestions{padding:10px 20px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;border-top:1px solid rgba(212,175,55,.1);background:var(--bg);flex-shrink:0;}
.sug{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);border:1px solid var(--dim);padding:5px 12px;cursor:pointer;transition:all .2s;background:none;}
.sug:hover{color:var(--gold);border-color:var(--g2);background:rgba(212,175,55,.04);}

.input-bar{padding:12px 20px;border-top:1px solid rgba(212,175,55,.12);display:flex;gap:10px;background:var(--bg2);flex-shrink:0;}
.chat-input{flex:1;background:var(--bg3);border:1px solid var(--dim);color:var(--cream);padding:11px 16px;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:13px;outline:none;transition:border-color .2s;}
.chat-input::placeholder{color:var(--muted);}
.chat-input:focus{border-color:var(--g2);}
.send-btn{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--gold),var(--g2));border:none;color:#07070D;padding:11px 20px;cursor:pointer;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;transition:all .2s;flex-shrink:0;}
.send-btn:hover{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--g2),var(--gold));transform:scale(1.04);}
.send-btn:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed;}

/* WELCOME CARD */
.welcome{text-align:center;padding:40px 20px;max-width:540px;margin:0 auto;}
.welcome img{width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid var(--gold);margin:0 auto 16px;}
.welcome h2{font-family:'Cinzel Decorative',serif;font-size:20px;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:6px;font-weight:900;}
.welcome p{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.85;font-weight:300;}

@media(max-width:700px){.sidebar{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;bottom:0;z-index:100;transform:translateX(-100%);transition:transform .3s;}.sidebar.open{transform:translateX(0);}.sidebar.collapsed{width:280px;transform:translateX(-100%);}}

/* ═ RESPONSIVE ALL DEVICES ═ */
*{max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;}
img{max-width:100%;height:auto;}
@media(max-width:900px){
  .nav-links{display:none!important;}.hamburger{display:block!important;}
  .section,.section-sm{padding:64px 18px!important;}
  .grid-2,.grid-3{grid-template-columns:1fr!important;gap:18px!important;}
  .sh h2{font-size:clamp(18px,6vw,28px)!important;}
  .price-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr!important;max-width:440px;margin:0 auto;}
  [style*="grid-template-columns:repeat(3"]{grid-template-columns:1fr!important;}
  [style*="grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr"]{grid-template-columns:1fr!important;}
  .btn{letter-spacing:2px!important;font-size:10px!important;}
  .tech-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr!important;}
}
@media(min-width:601px)and(max-width:900px){
  .grid-3{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)!important;}
  [style*="grid-template-columns:repeat(3"]{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)!important;}
  .tech-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)!important;}
}
@media(max-width:480px){
  .section{padding:44px 14px!important;}
  .card,.nei-card{padding:20px 14px!important;}
  [style*="display:flex"]{flex-wrap:wrap!important;}
  .hero-btns{flex-direction:column;align-items:center;}
  .lead-form{flex-direction:column!important;}
  .lead-input{width:100%!important;}
}
@media(min-width:769px)and(max-width:1024px){
  .section{padding:80px 28px!important;}
  .container{max-width:960px;}
  .grid-3{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)!important;}
}
@media(max-width:600px){
  .footer{padding:36px 16px;}
  .footer-links{gap:12px;}
}
@media(min-width:1400px){
  .container{max-width:1260px;}
}
@media(max-width:1023px){
  body{padding-bottom:56px;}
}


/* ═══ PREMIUM COLOR SYSTEM ═══ */
:root{--gold:#C9A84C;--gold2:#A07828;--gold3:#D4A843;--gold-hi:#E8C060;--cream:#F0DFC0;--cream2:#D8C8A0;--muted:#9A8060;--dim:#5A3E18;--navy:#1A2A4A;--blood:#7B1A1A;--card-bg:#15100A;--card-border:rgba(201,168,76,0.18);}
body{background:#0B0906!important;color:#F0DFC0!important;}
h1,h2,h3{color:#F0DFC0!important;text-shadow:1px 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.8)!important;}
.card,.nei-card{background:#15100A!important;border-color:rgba(201,168,76,0.18)!important;}
.card:hover,.nei-card:hover{border-color:rgba(201,168,76,0.55)!important;}
p,.sh p,[class*="desc"],[class*="body"]{color:#9A8060!important;}
.sh-ey{color:#C9A84C!important;}
.sh-ey::before{background:linear-gradient(to right,transparent,#C9A84C)!important;}
.sh-ey::after{background:linear-gradient(to left,transparent,#C9A84C)!important;}
.btn-gold,.btn-jade{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#C9A84C,#A07828,#C9A84C)!important;background-size:200%!important;color:#0B0906!important;font-weight:800!important;}
.btn-ghost{color:#C9A84C!important;border-color:rgba(201,168,76,0.5)!important;}
.footer{background:#070504!important;border-top-color:rgba(201,168,76,0.15)!important;}
.footer-brand{color:#C9A84C!important;}
.nav.scrolled{background:rgba(8,6,4,0.97)!important;}
.nav-a{color:#D8C8A0!important;}
.nav-a:hover,.nav-a.active{color:#C9A84C!important;}
* {word-break:keep-all;overflow-wrap:break-word;}
@media(max-width:600px){.hero-btns{flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:10px;width:100%;padding:0 16px;}
.hero-btns a,.hero-btns button{width:100%;max-width:340px;font-size:10px!important;letter-spacing:1.5px!important;padding:13px 14px!important;white-space:normal;text-align:center;line-height:1.4;word-break:break-word;}}

</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="layout">

  <!-- SIDEBAR -->
  <div class="sidebar" id="sidebar">
    <div class="sidebar-header">
      <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Yangyiquan"/>
      <div><div class="sidebar-title">YANGYIQUAN AI</div><div class="sidebar-sub">Conocimiento completo del Dossier Base</div></div>
    </div>

    <div class="sidebar-section">Sistema</div>
    <button class="topic-btn" onclick="ask('What is Yangyiquan and what makes it original?')"><span class="dot"></span>¿Qué es el Yangyiquan?</button>
    <button class="topic-btn" onclick="ask('Cuéntame sobre la filosofía and three virtues of Yangyiquan.')"><span class="dot"></span>Philosophy & 3 Virtues</button>
    <button class="topic-btn" onclick="ask('Explica Yi, Qi y Dan Tian in Yangyiquan.')"><span class="dot"></span>Yi · Qi · Dan Tian</button>
    <button class="topic-btn" onclick="ask('¿Qué es el Fajin y cómo se genera?')"><span class="dot"></span>Fajin · Explosive Power</button>

    <div class="sidebar-section">9 Internal Powers</div>
    <button class="topic-btn" onclick="ask('Explain the 4 Extreme Powers of Nei Gong.')"><span class="dot"></span>Poderes Extremos (I–IV)</button>
    <button class="topic-btn" onclick="ask('Explain all 5 Intermediate Powers of Nei Gong.')"><span class="dot"></span>Poderes Intermedios (I–V)</button>
    <button class="topic-btn" onclick="ask('¿Qué es Yi Jing — el poder del Ya Está?')"><span class="dot"></span>Yi Jing · The Already-Is</button>

    <div class="sidebar-section">Arsenal Técnico</div>
    <button class="topic-btn" onclick="ask('Explica las 6 técnicas del Dragón.')"><span class="dot"></span>6 Dragon Techniques</button>
    <button class="topic-btn" onclick="ask('What are the main combat tactics of Yangyiquan?')"><span class="dot"></span>Combat Tactics</button>
    <button class="topic-btn" onclick="ask('What are the biomechanical principles of the system?')"><span class="dot"></span>Principios Biomecánicos</button>

    <div class="sidebar-section">Dao Zhiliao</div>
    <button class="topic-btn" onclick="ask('¿Qué es el Dao Zhiliao y qué incluye?')"><span class="dot"></span>Dao Zhiliao Overview</button>
    <button class="topic-btn" onclick="ask('Cuéntame sobre las 5 fórmulas Dit Da Jow.')"><span class="dot"></span>5 Dit Da Jow Formulas</button>
    <button class="topic-btn" onclick="ask('¿Cómo funciona la terapia energética Yin-Yang?')"><span class="dot"></span>Yin-Yang Therapy</button>
    <button class="topic-btn" onclick="ask('¿Qué es la intención terapéutica Yi?')"><span class="dot"></span>Yi Therapeutic Intention</button>

    <div class="sidebar-section">Clases & Libros</div>
    <button class="topic-btn" onclick="ask('¿Cuáles son los planes de entrenamiento y precios?')"><span class="dot"></span>Clases Plans & Pricing</button>
    <button class="topic-btn" onclick="ask('Cuéntame sobre los 3 volúmenes del Yangyiquan.')"><span class="dot"></span>The 3-Volume Set</button>
    <button class="topic-btn" onclick="ask('How can I contact Pedro Barros, Instructor Jefe?')"><span class="dot"></span>Contacto & Location</button>

    <div class="sidebar-footer">
      <a class="back-link" href="index.html">← ← Volver al Yangyiquan</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- MAIN CHAT -->
  <div class="main">
    <div class="chat-header">
      <div class="chat-header-left">
        <button class="sidebar-toggle" onclick="toggleSidebar()" title="Temas">☰</button>
        <div class="chat-avatar"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt=""/></div>
        <div>
          <div class="chat-name">ASISTENTE YANGYIQUAN</div>
          <div class="chat-status"><div class="status-dot"></div>En línea · Conocimiento completo del Dossier</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="font-family:'Cinzel',serif;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:3px;color:var(--dim);">Pregunta cualquier cosa sobre el sistema</div>
    </div>

    <div class="chat-messages" id="chat-messages">
      <div class="welcome">
        <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Yangyiquan"/>
        <h2>Asistente AI del Yangyiquan</h2>
        <div style="font-family:'Ma Shan Zheng',serif;font-size:26px;color:var(--gold);opacity:.8;margin:8px 0;letter-spacing:8px;">阳意拳法</div>
        <p>Estoy entrenado con el Dossier Oficial completo del Yangyiquan — desde los 9 Poderes Internos (Nei Gong) hasta las 6 técnicas del Dragón, la medicina Dao Zhiliao, las fórmulas Dit Da Jow y los fundamentos filosóficos del sistema. Pregúntame cualquier cosa.</p>
        <div style="font-family:'Cinzel',serif;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:3px;color:var(--dim);margin-top:14px;">Sultan Assad Abd-Al-Ghalib · Pedro Barros · Granada, España</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="suggestions" id="suggestions">
      <button class="sug" onclick="ask('¿Qué es el Yangyiquan?')">¿Qué es el Yangyiquan?</button>
      <button class="sug" onclick="ask('Explain Yi Jing — The Already-Is power')">¿Poder Yi Jing?</button>
      <button class="sug" onclick="ask('Tell me about Dao Zhiliao')">¿Dao Zhiliao?</button>
      <button class="sug" onclick="ask('What are the Dit Da Jow formulas?')">¿Dit Da Jow?</button>
      <button class="sug" onclick="ask('Explain the Long Di Quan technique')">¿Long Di Quan?</button>
      <button class="sug" onclick="ask('What are the training prices?')">¿Precios?</button>
    </div>

    <div class="input-bar">
      <input class="chat-input" id="chat-input" type="text" placeholder="Pregunta sobre el sistema, técnicas, Nei Gong, Dao Zhiliao…" maxlength="300"/>
      <button class="send-btn" id="send-btn" onclick="sendMsg()">➤</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// COMPREHENSIVE KNOWLEDGE BASE — from Yangyiquan Dossier Oficial
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
const KB = {

  // ── SYSTEM OVERVIEW ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  system: {
    keys: ['what is yangyiquan','origin','system','style','original','cosmos','independent','autonomous','fundador','founder','pedro barros','sultan','shénmì lóng','mystical dragon','sda','association'],
    response: `<strong>Yangyiquan Kung Fu (阳意拳法)</strong> is a complete original martial system — a martial cosmos — founded by <strong>Pedro Barros (Sultan Assad Abd-Al-Ghalib)</strong>, known in martial circles as <em>Shénmì Lóng (神秘龙) — The Mystical Dragon</em>.

The name encodes its complete essence in three Chinese characters:
• <span class="zh">阳</span> <strong>Yang</strong> — Light, Sun, the Luminous and Active Principle of the universe. Internal illumination of consciousness.
• <span class="zh">意</span> <strong>Yi</strong> — Intention, Mind, Will. The pulsing core: the idea that precedes movement, the thought that governs energy.
• <span class="zh">拳</span> <strong>Quan</strong> — Fist, system of combat. Not merely a physical strike, but the totality of structured techniques, principles and philosophy.

Translated with precision: <em>"The Fist of the Light of Intention"</em>. The system postulates that supremacy in combat resides not in muscle mass or brute speed, but in the clarity and purity of mental intention. Built upon decades of training under <strong>Shifu Diogo SantAna</strong> (Yang Taijiquan, Chen Taijiquan, Nanquan) and <strong>Sensei Carmindo Paiva</strong> (Karate Shukokai), and officially presented for international recognition.

It is a living system — actively in development. Each technique is studied, tested and refined over time.`
  },

  // ── PHILOSOPHY ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  philosophy: {
    keys: ['philosophy','philosophi','victoria sin batalla','victory without','sun tzu','supreme','dimensions','exterior','interior','cosmic','principio supremo'],
    response: `The supreme philosophical principle of Yangyiquan:

<strong>"The greatest war you have won is the one you did not begin."</strong>

This axiom, pronounced by el Instructor, resonates with Sun Tzu — but elevates strategy to a universal spiritual law. The Yangyiquan recognizes <strong>three dimensions of conflict</strong>:

• <strong>The Exterior War</strong> — physical combat
• <strong>The Interior War</strong> — combat against one's own fears, vices and limitations
• <strong>The Cosmic War</strong> — the confrontation between light and darkness at universal scale

The true warrior conquers the interior world first. From that fortress of peace, they face the exterior world with a serenity that confuses and paralyzes the adversary.

The central paradox: <em>"The best attack is defense."</em> Every physical attack in Yangyiquan must be born from a pure mental intention of protection and justice. The warrior who attacks to defend invokes the cosmic law of justice to their side, exponentially multiplying effectiveness.`
  },

  // ── THREE VIRTUES ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  virtues: {
    keys: ['virtue','virtud','paciencia','patience','bondad','kindness','perdon','forgiveness','inquebrantable','tres virtudes','three virtue'],
    response: `The <strong>Three Unbreakable Virtues of Yangyiquan</strong> — the foundation of all practice:

<strong>I. PATIENCE (忍) — Mastery of Suffering</strong>
Patience in Yangyiquan is not passive resignation; it is the active manifestation of interior mastery. The warrior absorbs the blow of suffering as water absorbs rock: without breaking. In combat: the patient warrior observes, accumulates information, concentrates force in the Dan Tian, and releases all potency at the precise instant of maximum adversary opening. El Instructor teaches: <em>"When you wish to speak ill of someone, do not say it; you will see marvels blossom within you."</em>

<strong>II. KINDNESS (善) — Water that Gives Life</strong>
Not naïve or sentimental kindness, but kindness as deep comprehension of human nature. The advanced practitioner develops the capacity of Shén Shí — placing themselves in the emotional place of the adversary, feeling their deepest fears and most hidden intentions. This martial empathy doesn't weaken — it makes infinitely more effective, because it understands the enemy better than the enemy understands himself.

<strong>III. FORGIVENESS (宽) — Liberation</strong>
Not a sentimental concession, but a strategic act. Not forgiving is like holding a ball of fire: whoever suffers most is the one holding it. Not forgiving creates energetic blockages that cloud the Yi and obstruct Qi flow — making maximum potency impossible.`
  },

  // ── YI QI DANTIAN ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  foundations: {
    keys: ['yi ','qi ','dan tian','dantian','intention','intenção','energia vital','vital energy','fajin','explosion','three pillar','tres pilar'],
    response: `The <strong>Three Pillars of Yangyiquan</strong>:

<span class="zh">意</span> <strong>Yi — Intention</strong>
Without Yi, there is no true Wushu. Intention is the commander — the idea that precedes and governs every movement. The Yi guides the Qi; without clear intention, technique becomes merely mechanical. Clases cultivates the ability to project intention beyond the physical movement itself.

<span class="zh">气</span> <strong>Qi — Vital Energy</strong>
Qi flows through the meridians. In Yangyiquan it is cultivated through breath, posture and presence. Directed by Yi, it flows to the Dan Tian and is stored for controlled release.

<span class="zh">丹田</span> <strong>Dan Tian — The Cinnabar Field</strong>
The body's primary energetic centre — approximately three finger-widths below the navel. Three Dan Tian exist:
• <strong>Xia Dantian</strong> (Lower) — physical power reservoir, source of Fajin
• <strong>Zhong Dantian</strong> (Middle) — emotional and relational centre
• <strong>Shang Dantian</strong> (Upper / Third Eye) — mental and spiritual power

<strong>Fajin (发劲)</strong> — the explosive release of Qi accumulated in the Dan Tian. La cadena de fuerza: feet → knees → hips → spine → shoulder → termination point. Muscles remain completely relaxed until the millisecond of impact — maximizando la velocidad, reduciendo el gasto energético y haciendo el movimiento impredecible.`
  },

  // ── NEI GONG EXTREME ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
  neiExtreme: {
    keys: ['nei gong','9 power','nine power','internal power','extreme power','poder extremo','internal work','已','yì jīng','ya está','already','tian heaven','di ci','earth magnet','di yu','underworld'],
    response: `<strong>Nei Gong (内功) — The 9 Internal Powers</strong>

Articulated and named by Pedro Barros, Instructor Jefe — the psychological, spiritual and tactical foundation of Yangyiquan.

<strong>THE 4 EXTREME POWERS:</strong>

<strong>I. Yi Jing — "The Already-Is"</strong>
The highest power. Reality already exists complete and perfect, hidden from ordinary perception. The practitioner who attains this state sees things as they truly are — without ego distortion, fear or hasty judgment. <em>7 Keys:</em> Visualization (seeing before seeing), Meditative Comprehension, The Liberating Word, Intentional Sowing, Remembrance of Mastery, Universal Dominion, Divinization.

<strong>II. Tiān (天) — Heaven</strong>
Alignment with universal laws. When the warrior acts in perfect consonance with justice, truth and compassion, the power of Heaven flows through them. Manifests as high-precision martial intuition — perceiving the adversary's intention before it materializes.

<strong>III. Dì Cí (地磁) — Earth-Magnet</strong>
The gravitational and magnetic force of Earth as stable power. Teaches absorbing Qi from Earth through the feet, storing in the lower Dan Tian, releasing as Fajin. The biomechanical foundation of all devastating techniques.

<strong>IV. Dì Yù (地狱) — The Underworld</strong>
Mastery over hidden dark forces. The capacity to absorb the adversary's destructive energy so that it returns against them, exhausting itself without damaging the practitioner.`
  },

  // ── NEI GONG INTERMEDIATE ──────────────────────────────────────────────
  neiInter: {
    keys: ['intermediate power','poder intermedio','shén shí','identify heart','chuang','creation','zhan cut','bao treasure','zhi immortal','yin yang mastery'],
    response: `<strong>THE 5 INTERMEDIATE POWERS of Nei Gong:</strong>

<strong>I. Shén Shí (神识) — Identify the Heart of the Other</strong>
Placing oneself in the emotional space of the adversary — sensing from within their deepest motivations and most concealed intentions. If they attack from fear → amplify it. From anger → let it cause overextension. From cold calculation → introduce unpredictability. Also the foundation of Dao Zhiliao therapeutic practice.

<strong>II. Chuāng Zào (创造) — Creation</strong>
Observing nature to extract martial principles and create original techniques. <em>5 Pillars:</em> (1) Create own techniques (2) Practice alone (3) Practice with partner (4) Apply in controlled combat (5) Apply in real combat. <em>"Without these 5 pillars, genuine Kung Fu dies."</em>

<strong>III. Zhǎn (斩) — The Cut</strong>
Deliberately severing energetic, psychological and karmic bonds that weaken effectiveness. Physically: knife-edge of hand, elbow as axe, fingers as lance. The fingertip has an invisible energetic extension penetrating the adversary's field before physical contact.

<strong>IV. Bǎo (宝) — Hidden Treasure</strong>
Qi understood as information — totality of thoughts, intentions and energy states. At the critical moment, deep inhalation absorbs the adversary's Yang (their strength, courage, determination) while they lose these without understanding why.

<strong>V. Zhì (至) — The Immortal</strong>
Complete Yin-Yang mastery. <em>"Place Yin within you — receptivity, listening. Place Yang within you — light, initiative, force. Place Yin outside — mystery, shadow, unpredictability — draw the adversary toward your trap. He who has all of Yin and Yang within himself becomes a universe."</em>`
