<strong>龙底拳 Long Dǐ Quán — The Dragon's Earthly Punch</strong>
Devastating horizontal strike with full hip rotation. Force chain: feet → knees → hip → spine → shoulder → fist, released with Fajin. Targets: full face, solar plexus, sternum, neck, cervical spine.

<strong>龙闪爪 Long Shǎn Zhǎo — The Dragon Extends Its Claws</strong>
Técnica penetrante de dos fases. Phase 1: visual distraction/control. Phase 2: real strike to unprotected vital zone. Targets: eyes (tactical blindness), throat, solar plexus, vital neck points.

<strong>龙天拳 Long Tiān Quán — The Dragon's Celestial Punch</strong>
Golpe vertical ascendente — hook to jaw or direct to chin. Force rises from Earth through full kinetic chain. Targets: mandible (neurological KO), solar plexus, sternum, forehead.

<strong>龙尾鞭 Long Wěi Biān — The Dragon's Tail Whip</strong>
Defensa/ataque dual. Fase ascendente: intercepta golpes y patadas. Latigazo descendente: impacto devastador en cuello, nuca y mandíbula.

<strong>龙摔角 Long Suāi Jiǎo — The Dragon Breaks the Jaw</strong>
Cruz de alta potencia al ángulo mandibular. Activa los receptores de presión del nervio mandibular → cortocircuito neurológico → aturdimiento o nocaut inmediato.

<strong>龙战意 Long Zhàn Yì — The Dragon Opens Its Wings</strong>
Expansión bilateral explosiva del pecho sincronizada con inhalación profunda del Dan Tian. Defensivo: rompe agarres y clinch. Ofensivo: impacto simultáneo en ambos oídos (rotura timpánica), costillas o sienes. Voice (Kiai) amplifies the paralyzing psychological effect.`
